\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb200\li960\sl260 \fs20\lang1033\f0 This is the menu that appeared when the ACME logo card timed out. As you can see, it is a list of hyperlinks to other WML files, with each hyperlink being defined by its own a element. Note that the card begins with a do element, which implements a prev link to allow navigation back to the previous card.\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb100\li960\sl260 We selected the hyperlink 'ACME Vacancies' from this menu. As you can see from the source WML, that link goes to the file \fs18\f2 employ.wml\fs20\f0 , which looks like this:\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb200\li960\sl234 \fs18\lang1024\f2  <?xml version="1.0"?>\sa0\par\fi0\sb0
